cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: supereeg
abstract: >-
  supereeg is a Python toolbox for inferring whole-brain electrocorticographic
  (ECoG) activity from a sparse set of implanted electrode recordings.  It
  uses Gaussian process regression and a learned inter-electrode correlation
  model to reconstruct high-spatiotemporal estimates of activity throughout the
  brain.
